    "enUS": {
      "description": "In the northern areas of Winterspring, the Wildkin grow even more ferocious. We must continue our measures there.\n\nHunt the moontouched owlbeasts in Winterspring, and explore the area they inhabit.\n\nThis is dangerous ground, but I know that you will be able to handle the challenge. Return to me after you have slain 13 of the wildkin.",
